{#
  The review step "Send for approval" (editor-2-3-view.html's own footer
  bar) opens before the status actually changes — reached by capturing the
  editor's current live content first (the same fetch/payload "Save"/
  "Preview" already use, see that page's pageScripts), then navigating
  here rather than acting immediately, per the task this page was built
  from. GET /v6/editor-2-3-view/send-for-approval (controller.js) reads
  that just-captured req.session.data.editorExperimentPreview for the
  title and content sections (so this reflects the live, possibly
  reordered/renamed/unsaved state of the editor, not a stale copy), and
  guidanceDocuments for the real description where the session being
  edited has a real id.

  Back link ("Back to editor", res.locals.backHref/backLinkText,
  controller.js) is the only way back to the editor — no separate button
  duplicating it further down the page.

  The status badge shown here is deliberately the TARGET state (Awaiting
  approval, yellow — matching document-overview.html's own statusTags
  exactly), not the document's current one: this page is a preview of
  what is about to happen, not a record of what already has.

  Clicking "Send for approval" below POSTs to this same URL
  (postSendForApproval, controller.js) — the real state change: the id
  moves from Editing to Awaiting approval for the rest of the session
  (app/data/manage-guidance.js), then redirects straight to that
  document's own document-overview page, where the now-updated yellow
  badge and the loss of any edit option are visible proof the move
  actually happened, not just a message on this one page.
#}
{% extends "common/layouts/content.njk" %}

{% from "govuk/components/summary-list/macro.njk" import govukSummaryList %}
{% from "govuk/components/tag/macro.njk" import govukTag %}
{% from "govuk/components/button/macro.njk" import govukButton %}

{% set pageName = "Send for approval" %}

{% set sectionsCell %}
  {% if sections and sections.length %}
    <ol class="govuk-list govuk-list--number">
      {% for section in sections %}
        <li>{{ section.sectionName }}</li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ol>
  {% else %}
    No content sections
  {% endif %}
{% endset %}

{% set statusCell %}{{ govukTag({ text: "Awaiting approval", classes: "govuk-tag--yellow" }) }}{% endset %}

{% block columns %}

  <h1 class="govuk-heading-l">Send for approval</h1>

  <p class="govuk-body">
    Check the details below before sending this guidance for approval.
  </p>

  {{ govukSummaryList({
    rows: [
      { key: { text: "Guidance title" }, value: { text: documentName } },
      { key: { text: "Description" }, value: { text: description } },
      { key: { text: "Content sections" }, value: { html: sectionsCell } },
      { key: { text: "Status" }, value: { html: statusCell } }
    ]
  }) }}

  <p class="govuk-body">
    Sending this guidance for approval will change its status to Awaiting
    approval. It will no longer be editable until an owner reviews it.
  </p>

  <form method="post" action="/v6/editor-2-3-view/send-for-approval">
    {{ govukButton({ text: "Send for approval" }) }}
  </form>

{% endblock %}
